<metadata><name>Day 65 - Skinner's Woods, Len Holley, Chris Walker</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.776754" lon="-81.039717"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking on Gleason Lake Rd where the Curly Harnden Side Trail meets the Len…. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.788790" lon="-80.996630"><name>P2 alternative parking</name><desc>Roadside parking on Colpoy's Range Rd. Free. Joins the route near km 6.2 (140 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.783778" lon="-81.036910"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Skinner's Woods Side Trail, heading east. (the blue-blazed Len Holley Side Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.795124" lon="-81.025400"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn right onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.796594" lon="-81.002111"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn sharp right onto the blue-blazed Chris Walker Side Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.789680" lon="-80.995360"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Turnaround point. The side trail meets the white-blazed main Bruce Trail here. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.790079" lon="-81.040176"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Len Holley Side Trail, heading south-east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
